.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH closed 1  "closed " 
.SH NAME
closed \- List closed items (excluding archived). Ordered by close\-date descending (most recent first); override with `\-\-sort`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBclosed\fR [\fB\-\-sort\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List closed items (excluding archived). Ordered by close\-date descending (most recent first); override with `\-\-sort`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-sort\fR \fI<SORT>\fR
Sort order: `closed` | `id` | `rank` (default `closed`). An unknown key is a loud error
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
